nd players 😈, become the BIGGEST Fly in the game. \nThe more you eat - the more Dangerous you'll become\nExplore the map and its secrets, for some Food 🪰","path":"/game/110879202731218-fly-fly","slug":"110879202731218-fly-fly","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/69377168d6aa69e23ea6a59ec7242bb61f229117e3203dd5190b34cf9641366b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0d746cc2cb5ffbc40c9e138f95d56f5d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":10753216,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-07T21:53:03.369Z","creator":{"name":"Valrus is best scripter 2","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":137463553034738,"name":"[⛏️] Gilrock","desc":"Gilrock is a 2.5D mining game about hunting rare ores, from odds 1/20 to 1/2,000,000,000. The caverns are procedurally generated, meaning a fresh mine every run! Aside from just mining, you'll also find minigames and varied side-content.\n\n⚠️ [Beta Release]\n- The game is in active development with many planned changes.\n\n🎮 [Game Features]\n- Craft Pickaxes, Gears (like Speed Coils and Antimatter Bombs), paired with Consumables for you to rip apart the caverns. With more unlocks as you progress!\n- Chase unfathomably rare collectibles, tracked in a 244+ item-long Compendium!\n- Hybrid between manual/idle play with a built-in AFK Mode!\n\n❓ [How to Play]\n- Take the Mine Lift to the caverns.\n- Mine manually, or go idle with AFK Mode.\n- On PC, press [CTRL] to enable Smart Cursor.","path":"/game/137463553034738-gilrock","slug":"137463553034738-gilrock","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6e908ef7e9eeb3e0b819cf3523f4d969b60fbe2a4f29bfe2032e016fcc9d5c23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6d726b6fd19516931cf5d87d9b26db8f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":2256868,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-20T15:02:40.107Z","creator":{"name":"malter09","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id